- 明日方舟：终末地 BWIKI (wiki.biligame.com/zmd) — community wiki
- Game8 (game8.jp) — public article text referenced in `reference/DESIGN_SPEC.md`
- note.com — public article text referenced in `reference/DESIGN_SPEC.md`
- Bilibili (bilibili.com) — public community video titles referenced in `reference/DESIGN_SPEC.md`
